ack to the outer channel"},{"fr":"À retenir le sable","en":"To hold back the sand"},{"fr":"À faire tourner un moulin","en":"To turn a mill"},{"fr":"À traverser la rivière","en":"To cross the river"}],"answer":0,"why":{"fr":"Le tourbillon « bǎ shāzi hé shítou shuǎi guò Fēishāyàn ».","en":"The whirlpool “bǎ shāzi hé shítou shuǎi guò Fēishāyàn”."}},{"q":{"fr":"À quoi servent les trois hommes de pierre ?","en":"What are the three stone men for?"},"options":[{"fr":"À mesurer le niveau de l'eau","en":"To measure the water level"},{"fr":"À décorer","en":"To decorate"},{"fr":"À honorer Li Bing","en":"To honour Li Bing"},{"fr":"À faire peur aux poissons","en":"To scare the fish"}],"answer":0,"why":{"fr":"C'est la première « shuǐwèi chǐ » (échelle de niveau).","en":"It is the first “shuǐwèi chǐ” (water gauge)."}},{"q":{"fr":"Que signifie « Tiānfǔ zhī guó » ?","en":"What does “Tiānfǔ zhī guó” mean?"},"options":[{"fr":"Une terre aussi riche qu'un grenier céleste","en":"A land as rich as a heavenly granary"},{"fr":"Le pays du ciel bleu","en":"The land of the blue sky"},{"fr":"Le royaume des dieux","en":"The kingdom of the gods"},{"fr":"Le pays des rivières","en":"The land of rivers"}],"answer":0,"why":{"fr":"« xiàng tiānshang de cāngkù yíyàng fùyǒu de dìfang ».","en":"“xiàng tiānshang de cāngkù yíyàng fùyǒu de dìfang”."}},{"q":{"fr":"Que se passe-t-il pour Dujiangyan lors du séisme de 2008 ?","en":"What happens to Dujiangyan in the 2008 earthquake?"},"options":[{"fr":"Il n'est que légèrement endommagé et vite réparé","en":"It is only slightly damaged and quickly repaired"},{"fr":"Il est complètement détruit","en":"It is completely destroyed"},{"fr":"Il n'existe plus depuis longtemps","en":"It had long ceased to exist"},{"fr":"Il provoque une inondation","en":"It causes a flood"}],"answer":0,"why":{"fr":"« zhǐ shòu le yìdiǎnr qīngshāng, hěn kuài jiù xiūhǎo le ».","en":"“zhǐ shòu le yìdiǎnr qīngshāng, hěn kuài jiù xiūhǎo le”."}}],"id":"libing","order":106,"category":"history","lev